{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02721","headline":"昭君怨 · 张文琮","name":"昭君怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"戒途飞万里，回首望三秦。\n忽见天山雪，还疑上苑春。\n玉痕垂粉泪，罗袂拂胡尘。\n爲得胡中曲，还悲远嫁人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张文琮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}